    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Ray Cooke are delighted to present this exceptional luxury family residence to the market. 'St. Johns' is a magnificent four-bedroom detached dormer bungalow extending to approximately 318 sq.m. (3,423 sq.ft.), occupying a stunning c. 1.25-acre site on the highly sought-after Kilteel Road, Rathcoole, Co. Dublin.\n\nBeautifully presented throughout, this impressive home offers an outstanding blend of luxury, privacy and contemporary family living. Flooded with natural light, the property boasts generous, well-proportioned accommodation finished to a high standard throughout. A key feature of this exceptional home is the substantial one-bedroom self-contained annex 107 sq.m, providing versatile accommodation ideal for extended family, guests, a home office or potential rental income.\n\nThe location is second to none, with Rathcoole Village just five minutes away, offering an excellent selection of schools, shops, cafés, Avoca, Rathcoole Park and an array of local amenities. The N7 and M50 motorway networks are within easy reach, providing excellent connectivity to Dublin City Centre and beyond, while several of Ireland's finest golf courses are also close by.\n\nThe bright and spacious accommodation has been thoughtfully designed for modern family living. Upon entering, the welcoming entrance hallway leads to elegant reception room, home cinema, including a spacious lounge and dining room, while the heart of the home is the stunning open-plan kitchen, which flows seamlessly overlooking the landscaped gardens. Upstairs offers the bedroom accommodation is generously proportioned, with luxurious bathrooms and high-quality finishes throughout, creating the perfect retreat for family living.\n\nOutside, the property is approached via impressive electric entrance gates, leading to a sweeping driveway Main drive way is hand laid granite. with ample parking. The beautifully landscaped gardens surround the home, featuring mature planting, manicured lawns and an enviable south-facing rear aspect that enjoys sunshine throughout the day. The property also benefits from a large detached one-bedroom annex 107 sq.m, offering exceptional flexibility, together with extensive outdoor space ideal for entertaining or family enjoyment.\n\nRarely does a home of this calibre come to the market, combining luxurious accommodation, exceptional privacy, generous grounds and a highly desirable location. Viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate everything this outstanding property has to offer. Contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today to arrange your private viewing.\n\nFeatures\n<ul>\n <li>Approx. 318 sq.m. (3,423 sq.ft.) of luxurious living accommodation</li>\n <li>Exceptional four-bedroom detached dormer bungalow</li>\n <li>Large one-bedroom self-contained annex</li>\n <li>Set on c. 1.25 acres of landscaped gardens</li>\n <li>Electric gated entrance</li>\n <li>Beautifully landscaped gardens with mature planting</li>\n <li>Spacious, light-filled accommodation throughout</li>\n <li>BER C1</li>\n <li>Oil-fired central heating</li>\n <li>Full alarm system</li>\n <li>Immaculate condition throughout</li>\n <li>Ideal family home in an exclusive setting</li>\n <li>South-facing rear garden</li>\n <li>Five minutes to Rathcoole Village</li>\n <li>Excellent access to the N7, M50 and Dublin City Centre</li>\n <li>Close to schools, shops, Avoca, parks and renowned golf courses</li>\n <li>Viewing is highly recommended</li>\n</ul>"
      },
